Re-dream** (dream_20260520T233719): 进行中，验证 D015 修正\\\\n- **exp-010 预分析**: binarized Likert p=0.636，C2 安全（Agent 正式执行中）\\\\n- **Register pilot**: 运行中 (cuda:0+1)\\\\n- **exp-002 benchmark data**: AlpacaEval 100 + MT-Bench 80 ready\\\\n- **Introduction draft**: 完成，Reviewer 反馈 3 项 warning，Paper Agent 修复中\\\\n- **API 402 阻塞**: OpenRouter 余额不足，所有 scoring 实验阻塞\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] exp-010 正式执行（零成本，C2 命门）— 已派 Agent\\\\n- [ ] exp-011 NLI threshold sensitivity（零成本）— 已派 Agent\\\\n- [ ] exp-012 consistency filter bias（零成本）— 已派 Agent\\\\n- [ ] exp-014 logistic regression / direction subset（零成本）— 已派 Agent\\\\n- [ ] Register pilot 结果评估\\\\n- [ ] Re-dream 结果分析 → 决定是否批准 P0 实验\\\\n- [ ] API key 恢复后：exp-001 (multi-judge) + exp-005 (RATE control) + verbosity scoring\\\\n- [ ] verbosity_32b registry conclusion 更新为 \\\\\\\"partial\\\\\\\"\\\\n- [ ] Introduction BERTScore 描述修复 + bib 占位符修复\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划\\\\n详见 experiment_plan.yaml（15 个实验，P0×5 + P1×7 + P2×3）。\\\\n零成本 reanalysis (exp-010/011/012/014) 不需 dream 审批，已批量派出。\\\\nP0 API 实验 (exp-001/002/005) 等 re-dream + API key 恢复后批准。\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n4× RTX PRO 6000 96GB (westb-29275), cuda:3 driver anomaly 不可用。\\\\n当前：cuda:0+1 跑 register pilot，cuda:2 空闲。\\\\nAPI 预算：$270-400，当前 OpenRouter 余额不足待充值。\\\\n\\\\n## Kill Criteria\\\\n- Rewrite iterations: 2/2 consumed (32B formality + 32B verbosity)\\\\n- Pairwise scoring: 不消耗 iteration\\\\n- 如 re-dream best < 3.5 → 考虑 pivot\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D019 | 2026-05-21 | Register pilot: NLI-only 95% PASS (19/20), joint g | exp-008 |\\\\n| D018 | 2026-05-21 | exp-014 pair-level bootstrap/GEE fix confirmed: fo | exp-014 |\\\\n| D017 | 2026-05-20 | exp-011/012/014 全部 SUCCESS: NLI threshold robust,  | exp-011, exp-012, exp-014 |\\\\n| D016 | 2026-05-20 | exp-010 PASS: Binarized Likert sign test confirms  | exp-010 |\\\\n| D015 | 2026-05-20 | Dream 1 三档均 3.0/6 (Findings)：修正 title/framing/clai | dream_20260520T211832 |\\\\n| D014 