ch 2025, Counterfactual Rhetorical 2025? Are there papers on Likert vs pairwise comparison in NLG evaluation that should be cited?\n3. **Differentiation from RATE**: The paper uses RATE's double-rewrite protocol in Stage 4 and follows their counterfactual rewriting approach. How clearly does this paper differentiate its contribution from RATE?\n4. **Scope of contribution vs. claims**: Are the claims appropriately scoped given the evidence? The paper has honest hedging but is it enough?\n5. **Significance and impact**: Would this change how people do LLM evaluation? Is the Likert blindspot finding actionable?\n6. **Writing quality**: Is the paper well-written, well-organized, appropriately concise?\n\nOutput your review in this format:\n\n### R2 Review: Novelty + Related Work\n\n**Summary** (2-3 sentences)\n\n**Strengths** (numbered list)\n\n**Weaknesses** (numbered list, with severity: major/minor)\n\n**Questions for Authors** (numbered list)\n\n**Novelty Assessment** (detailed paragraph)\n\n**Related Work Gaps**\n\n**Significance / Impact Assessment**\n\n**Score:** X/6\n**Confidence:** high/medium/low\n","uuid":"18f878c9-8966-4f0f-b742-598fddf05516","session_id":"5c652419-1a9d-459e-888f-3d09be196f6a"}
