{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VrJtPmcNiQZ5TdKa2W9hSV","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — causal_style_decomp_judge\n2\t\n3\t> Dream 1 (dream_20260520T211832) 三档均 3.0/6 (Findings)。以下为 D015 修正版。\n4\t\n5\t## Target Venue\n6\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (via ARR)\n7\t- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n8\t- Deadline: ARR June 2026 cycle (submission ~June 15)\n9\t- Format: Long paper, 8-page main text + unlimited references\n10\t\n11\t## Title (Dream 修正)\n12\t**旧**: \"Causal Style Decomposition Reveals Systematic Style Bias in LLM-as-Judge That Likert Scoring Misses\"\n13\t**新**: \"The Likert Blindspot: Detecting Hidden Style Bias in LLM Judges via Counterfactual Pairwise Comparison\"\n14\t- 理由：三档审稿人一致认为 \"decomposition\" 和 \"framework\" 过度承诺。新标题聚焦最强发现 (C2) 且更准确。\n15\t\n16\t## Core Claims (3 条 + 1 practical，修正后)\n17\t\n18\t### C1 (Method — 降级表述): Counterfactual pairwise comparison 可以 post-hoc 检测 black-box LLM judge 的 style bias\n19\t- ⚠️ Dream 反馈：不是新 \"framework\"，是已知组件（counterfactual rewriting + NLI verification + pairwise comparison）的新应用。论文中必须明确 acknowledge 组件来源（RATE, style transfer evaluation, MT-Bench pairwise）并定位为 application contribution。\n20\t- 证伪条件：pairwise win rate 在 45-55% 且 p>0.10（所有 judge × benchmark 组合）\n21\t- 状态：formality 69.1% (p=0.006) on GPT-4o × LLMBar ✅\n22\t\n23\t### C2 (Measurement Insight — 主贡献，强化): Likert pointwise scoring 系统性低估 style bias — \"Likert Blindspot\"\n24\t- ⚠️ Dream 反馈：需要 sign-test on binarized Likert 控制实验来隔离 pairwise 的结构性优势 vs 统计检验选择差异。这是 C2 的命门。\n25\t- 证伪条件：binarized Likert sign test 也显著 → gap 不在测量方法而在统计检验\n26\t- 状态：Likert p=0.332 vs Pairwise p=0.006，同一数据 ✅；binarized Likert control 待做\n27\t\n28\t### C3 (Empirical — 降级为 preliminary): Style bias 检测的可行性因 axis 语义性质而异\n29\t- ⚠️ Dream 反馈：只有 formality robust，\"multi-axis decomposition\" 和 \"prestige dimension\" 过度承诺。改为 \"preliminary evidence\" + \"method boundary\"。\n30\t- 新表述：\"content-preserving counterfactual intervention 适用于不改变信息量或认知承诺的 style axes（formality ✅, verbosity 需适配 ✅）；改变认知承诺的 axes（tone ❌）结构性不兼容\"\n31\t- 证伪条件：所有 surface-level axes 都一样 → 无 axis 依赖性\n32\t\n33\t### C4 (Practical — 新增): CSD-based 实用建议 / 轻量 correction\n34\t- ⚠️ Dream 反馈：\"detection-only, no correction\" 是三档一致的弱点。需要至少提供 practitioner guidance 或 lightweight correction component。\n35\t- 方案：(a) CSD-adjusted win rate = raw_win_rate - original_preference_estimate + 50%（需正式统计模型支撑）；(b) 实用建议清单：\"use pairwise over Likert for style bias audit; verify content preservation per axis; control for original preference\"\n36\t- 这不需要是完整的 debiasing 系统，但需要比纯 detection 多一步\n37\t\n38\t## Story Spine\n39\t\n40\t### Problem\n41\tLLM-as-judge 已成为 NLP 评估和对齐训练的核心基础设施。Style bias 是主宰偏差（SOS-Bench R=0.999, Soumik bias 0.76-0.92），但标准 Likert scoring 看不到它。\n42\t\n43\t### Existing Approaches & Their Gaps\n44\t- **LC-AlpacaEval (ICLR'25)**: 回归控制 length bias，简单有效但只处理一个维度，且提供 detection + correction\n45\t- **SOS-Bench (ICLR'25)**: 注入缺陷量化 judge 敏感度，相关性分析非因果\n46\t- **CASSE (2026)**: 12×12 style 矩阵，但因果纠缠\n47\t- **RATE (ICML'25)**: Double-rewrite ATE protocol — CSD 的 Stage 4 直接采用此方法（必须引用）\n48\t- **Counterfactual Rhetorical (2025)**: 最近的方法论 predecessor — persona counterfactual + BT aggregation\n49\t- **Gap**: 无人系统性比较 Likert vs pairwise 在 style bias 检测中的 sensitivity gap\n50\t\n51\t### Our Framing (修正)\n52\t我们用 binary style counterfactual + position-controlled pairwise comparison 检测 LLM judge 的 per-axis causal style bias。核心发现不是\"我们提出了一个新框架\"，而是**标准 Likert 评估系统性掩盖了 style bias（p=0.33 vs p=0.006）**，这对依赖 Likert scoring 的整个 LLM 评估生态有直接影响。\n53\t\n54\t### Headline Result Template\n55\t\"Standard Likert scoring declares no style bias (p={likert_p}), but position-controlled pairwise comparison on the same counterfactual data reveals significant {axis} preference ({win_rate}%, p<{p_value}) — this Likert Blindspot persists across {N} judges and {M} benchmarks.\"\n56\t\n57\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Mitigation (Dream 更新)\n58\t\n59\t### RC1 (致命级): \"只有一个 judge 和一个 benchmark\" → exp-001, exp-002\n60\t### RC2 (重伤级): \"Likert-Pairwise gap 是统计检验选择差异不是测量方法差异\" → **exp-010 (NEW): sign-test on binarized Likert**\n61\t### RC3 (重伤级): \"方向不对称 = original preference\" → exp-005 (扩展到所有 judge×benchmark)\n62\t### RC4 (中等级): \"Novelty incremental, 组件都是已知的\" → 重新定位为 application + empirical contribution，诚实 acknowledge 组件来源\n63\t### RC5 (中等级): \"Detection-only, no correction\" → C4 (practical guidance + lightweight correction)\n64\t### RC6 (中等级): \"C3 oversold\" → 降级为 preliminary，reframe title\n65\t### RC7 (低级): \"n=100 太小\" → exp-006 (n=500) + power analysis\n66\t### RC8 (低级): \"NLI threshold arbitrary\" → exp-011 sensitivity analysis\n67\t### RC9 (低级): \"No counterfactual examples\" → 论文添加 2-3 annotated examples\n68\t\n69\t## Narrative Strategy (保持，但标题修正)\n70\t\n71\t### Type: 突破局限型 + \"普遍实践+隐藏风险\" hook\n72\t### Title: \"The Likert Blindspot\" (命名最强发现)\n73\t### Intro P2 修正: \"但我们发现标准 Likert scoring 系统性掩盖 style bias — 同一数据上 Likert 报告无偏差（p=0.33），pairwise comparison 却检测到显著偏好（p<0.01）\"\n74\t\n75\t### Figure 1: Problem illustration (Likert vs Pairwise gap) — 保持\n76\t### Figure 2: Method overview — 保持\n77\t### Main Result Table: axes (rows) × judges (cols) × {Pairwise, Likert, Binarized-Likert} — 新增 binarized Likert 列\n78\t\n79\t## Bibliography 目标\n80\t从 10 refs → 25+ refs。必须引用：RATE, Counterfactual Rhetorical, FairJudge, Veitch et al. 2020, Soumik 2026, style transfer evaluation lit (Mir et al., Krishna et al.), Chatbot Arena/FairEval, human annotation agreement studies.\n81\t\n82\t## Venue Fit\n83\tEMNLP 2026 高度匹配。Dream 显示 Findings 确定可达，Main 需要：(1) binarized Likert 控制确认 C2；(2) 2+ judges significant after correction；(3) practical guidance component；(4) 25+ references。\n84\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01A8hKkQTMHuVeKn9Yx5jGLE","session_id":"5c652419-1a9d-459e-888f-3d09be196f6a","uuid":"420bbcfc-87bb-4b1c-b2b9-44a4beeeaacc","timestamp":"2026-05-21T00:26:02.232Z"}
